  "title": "Tamil Nadu extends maternity leave for third child to 365 days",
  "summary": "The Tamil Nadu government announced extending the maternity leave for its women employees for the birth of their third child from 12 weeks to 365 days, aligning with broader efforts to support families. This extension, as noted by the state's minister, aims to ensure comprehensive maternal care and social welfare.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Tamil Nadu's government extended maternity leave for the third child to 365 days from 12 weeks.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The original 90-day leave was raised to six months in 2011, nine months in 2016, and extended to one year (365 days) in July 2021.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The leave duration for married women with fewer than two surviving children is 365 days.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
